{
  "id": "c1-e44-parenting-styles",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Parenting styles",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how would you describe the way you were brought up?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what do you think is the most difficult part of being a parent?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how much influence do parents have on a child's character?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, would you like to raise children in the way you were raised?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e44-a1",
            "c1-e44-a2",
            "c1-e44-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show parents and children. Choose two of the pictures and say what the parents might be hoping for, and how the children might feel.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10300
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these parents would you most like to be?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e44-b1",
            "c1-e44-b2",
            "c1-e44-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show family life. Choose two of the pictures and say what difficulties these families might be dealing with, and how they could be solved.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, how important is it for families to eat together?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some approaches parents might take, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9500
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e44-parenting-styles",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these approaches affect a child as they grow up?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7000
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e44-parenting-styles",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is likely to have the most positive effect?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about parenting and upbringing.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent should parents protect children from failure?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think parents nowadays are too involved in their children's lives?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should parents control the technology their children use?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How much do you think a child's character is shaped by their family rather than by friends and school?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is it right for a parent to choose a child's career?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should the state ever step in if it disagrees with how a child is brought up?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e44-parenting-styles/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6400
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
